  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2507\">\n<p data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2327\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2325\">Normal Findings:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2507\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2404\">\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2404\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Karyotype: 46,XX or 46,XY (No numerical or structural abnormalities).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2461\">\n<p data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2461\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">FISH: Two signals for Chromosome 21 (no trisomy).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2507\">\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2507\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Microarray: No pathogenic CNVs detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2769\">\n<p data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2536\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2534\">Abnormal Findings:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2769\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2636\">\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2636\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2573\">Trisomy 21 (Down Syndrome):</strong> Three signals in FISH and confirmed by karyotype/microarray.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2769\">\n<p data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2769\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2678\">Other Chromosomal Abnormalities:</strong> Structural rearrangements, duplications, deletions, or microdeletions noted by microarray.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2966\">\n<p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2801\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2799\">Clinical Correlation:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2966\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2899\">\n<p data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2899\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Results must be correlated with ultrasound, maternal history, and other prenatal findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2966\">\n<p data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2966\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Genetic counseling is advised if any abnormality is detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
